      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>The pizmon, “Bar Yoḥai” was written by Rabbi Shimon ibn Lavi (1486–1585). A translation in Farsi is extant but we have not been able to locate a text yet. If you have one, please share it. The English translation here by Honi Sanders was published in the birkon for his wedding, <tei:hi rend="italic">Siman l’Vanim</tei:hi> (Dimus Parrhesia Press 2019). –Aharon Varady</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
